<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ app_name }}</title>
    <style>
        /* Self-contained: these tokens mirror Ions\Http\Ui\DesignSystem so the
           start page shares the framework's identity with the debug page,
           toolbar and error pages — no external CSS/asset pipeline needed. */
        :root {
            color-scheme: dark light;
            --ion-bg: #101218;
            --ion-surface: #16181d;
            --ion-text: #d8dce3;
            --ion-muted: #9aa4b2;
            --ion-accent: #818cf8;
            --ion-border: #2a2e36;
            --ion-code-bg: #0e1013;
            --ion-font-sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            --ion-font-mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0; min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: var(--ion-font-sans);
            color: var(--ion-text);
            background: var(--ion-bg) radial-gradient(60rem 40rem at 80% -10%, rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.22), transparent 60%);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
        }
        main { width: 100%; max-width: 52rem; }
        .wordmark { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
        .wordmark .logo { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: #fff; }
        .wordmark .logo span { color: var(--ion-accent); }
        .version {
            font: 0.8rem var(--ion-font-mono); color: var(--ion-muted);
            background: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.1); border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.15rem 0.6rem;
        }
        .tagline { color: var(--ion-muted); margin: 0 0 2rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
        .tagline strong { color: #c7cdd6; font-weight: 600; }
        .cards {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
            gap: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .card {
            display: block; text-decoration: none;
            background: var(--ion-surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--ion-border);
            border-radius: 10px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
            transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
        }
        .card:hover { border-color: var(--ion-accent); background: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.08); }
        .card h2 { margin: 0 0 0.3rem; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #e7eaf0; }
        .card p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.82rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ion-muted); }
        .quickstart {
            background: var(--ion-code-bg); border: 1px solid var(--ion-border);
            border-radius: 10px; padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
        }
        .quickstart h2 {
            margin: 0 0 0.6rem; font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--ion-muted);
        }
        .quickstart pre {
            margin: 0; overflow-x: auto;
            font: 0.85rem/1.8 var(--ion-font-mono); color: #c7cdd6;
        }
        .quickstart .c { color: #6b7280; }
        footer { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #6b7280; }
        footer code {
            background: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.12); border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem; font-size: 0.95em; color: #aab2f0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <div class="wordmark">
        <div class="logo">{{ app_name }}<span>.</span></div>
        <div class="version">Ions {{ ions_version }}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="tagline">Welcome — this application runs on the <strong>Ions PHP framework</strong>.</p>

    <div class="cards">
        <a class="card" href="https://github.com/tahadeveloper/ions.core/tree/main/docs">
            <h2>Documentation</h2>
            <p>Routing, controllers, views, auth, queues — the full framework reference.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="https://github.com/tahadeveloper/ions.core/blob/main/docs/best-practices.md">
            <h2>Best practices</h2>
            <p>Conventions for structuring, securing and testing an Ions application.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="https://github.com/tahadeveloper/ions.core/blob/main/docs/deploy.md">
            <h2>Deploying</h2>
            <p>Production checklist: caches, proxies, health probes and hardening.</p>
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="quickstart">
        <h2>Quick start</h2>
        <pre><span class="c"># serve the app locally</span>
php bin/ions serve

<span class="c"># check the host configuration</span>
php bin/ions doctor</pre>
    </div>

    <footer>
        Edit <code>views/home/index.twig</code> and <code>routes/web.php</code> to make this page yours.
    </footer>
</main>
</body>
</html>
